      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_MajoranaClifford_a_anticomm_of_orthogonal.lean",
      "title": "Orthogonal directions produce **anticommuting** field operators",
      "nl": "Orthogonal directions produce **anticommuting** field operators.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.MajoranaClifford.a_anticomm_of_orthogonal` (module `BookProof.MajoranaClifford`), line-linked source: `ChapterMajoranaClifford.lean` lines 111\u2013114.",
