      "title": "Proposition 61 (headline).** The boost intertwiner `U'` is unitary: it has the two-sided inverse `(U')\u2020`",
      "nl": "**Proposition 61 (headline).**  The boost intertwiner `U'` is unitary: it has the\ntwo-sided inverse `(U')\u2020`.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp61.prop61_isUnit` (module `BookProof.MajoranaProp61`), line-linked source: `ChapterMajoranaProp61.lean` lines 149\u2013158.",
