    "BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_note4_comp": {
      "name": "BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.note4_comp",
      "chapter": "ChapterMajoranaProp76",
      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_note4_comp.lean",
      "title": "Composition of Note-4 unitaries is a Note-4 unitary.** Surjectivity composes, and the diagonal-inner-preservation chains `\u27eag (f x), g (f x)\u27eb = \u27eaf x, f x\u27eb = \u27eax, x\u27eb`",
      "nl": "**Composition of Note-4 unitaries is a Note-4 unitary.**  Surjectivity\ncomposes, and the diagonal-inner-preservation chains\n`\u27eag (f x), g (f x)\u27eb = \u27eaf x, f x\u27eb = \u27eax, x\u27eb`.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.note4_comp` (module `BookProof.MajoranaProp76`), line-linked source: `ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean` lines 71\u201379.",
      "source": "https://github.com/leonardopedro/timepiece/blob/61595bc/BookProof/ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean#L71-L79",
      "tags": [
        "timepiece",
        "qym",
        "majorana",
        "particle-physics"
      ]
    },
    "BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_note4_conj": {
      "name": "BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.note4_conj",
      "chapter": "ChapterMajoranaProp76",
      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_note4_conj.lean",
      "title": "Conjugation preserves Note-4 unitarity.** If `V : H \u2192 H` is a Note-4 unitary and `\u0398 : H \u2243\u2097\u1d62[\ud835\udd5c] K` is a linear isometry equivalence, then the conjugate `\u0398 \u2218 V \u2218 \u0398\u207b\u00b9 : K \u2192 K` is a Note-4 uni",
      "nl": "**Conjugation preserves Note-4 unitarity.**  If `V : H \u2192 H` is a Note-4\nunitary and `\u0398 : H \u2243\u2097\u1d62[\ud835\udd5c] K` is a linear isometry equivalence, then the conjugate\n`\u0398 \u2218 V \u2218 \u0398\u207b\u00b9 : K \u2192 K` is a Note-4 unitary.  This is Proposition 76's \"same\nconjugation reason\": it is a composition of the unitaries `\u0398\u207b\u00b9`, `V`, `\u0398`.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.note4_conj` (module `BookProof.MajoranaProp76`), line-linked source: `ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean` lines 81\u201391.",
      "source": "https://github.com/leonardopedro/timepiece/blob/61595bc/BookProof/ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean#L81-L91",
      "tags": [
        "timepiece",
        "qym",
        "majorana",
        "particle-physics"
      ]
    },
    "BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_energyTransform_unitary": {
      "name": "BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.energyTransform_unitary",
      "chapter": "ChapterMajoranaProp76",
      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_energyTransform_unitary.lean",
      "title": "Proposition 76 (energy transform is unitary).** For any Note-4 unitary `V` (the time-Fourier transform `\ud835\udcd5_P(\u2212p\u2070)`) and any linear isometry equivalence `\u0398`, the energy transform `\ud835\udcd4 = \u0398 \u2218 V",
      "nl": "**Proposition 76 (energy transform is unitary).**  For any Note-4 unitary\n`V` (the time-Fourier transform `\ud835\udcd5_P(\u2212p\u2070)`) and any linear isometry equivalence\n`\u0398`, the energy transform `\ud835\udcd4 = \u0398 \u2218 V \u2218 \u0398\u207b\u00b9` is a Note-4 unitary.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.energyTransform_unitary` (module `BookProof.MajoranaProp76`), line-linked source: `ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean` lines 107\u2013112.",
      "source": "https://github.com/leonardopedro/timepiece/blob/61595bc/BookProof/ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean#L107-L112",
      "tags": [
        "timepiece",
        "qym",
        "majorana",
        "particle-physics"
      ]
    },
    "BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_energyMomentum_unitary": {
      "name": "BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.energyMomentum_unitary",
      "chapter": "ChapterMajoranaProp76",
      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_energyMomentum_unitary.lean",
      "title": "Proposition 76 (energy\u2013momentum transform is unitary).** Composing the energy transform `\ud835\udcd4` with the (unitary) Majorana\u2013Fourier transform `\ud835\udcd5_M` (any Note-4 unitary `FM : K \u2192 K`) yields the",
      "nl": "**Proposition 76 (energy\u2013momentum transform is unitary).**  Composing the\nenergy transform `\ud835\udcd4` with the (unitary) Majorana\u2013Fourier transform `\ud835\udcd5_M`\n(any Note-4 unitary `FM : K \u2192 K`) yields the unitary energy\u2013momentum transform\n`\ud835\udcd4 \u2218 \ud835\udcd5_M`.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.energyMomentum_unitary` (module `BookProof.MajoranaProp76`), line-linked source: `ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean` lines 114\u2013121.",
      "source": "https://github.com/leonardopedro/timepiece/blob/61595bc/BookProof/ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean#L114-L121",
      "tags": [
        "timepiece",
        "qym",
        "majorana",
        "particle-physics"
      ]
    },
    "BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_fourierTransform_isNote4Unitary": {
      "name": "BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.fourierTransform_isNote4Unitary",
      "chapter": "ChapterMajoranaProp76",
      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_fourierTransform_isNote4Unitary.lean",
      "title": "The Pauli\u2013Fourier transform `\ud835\udcd5_P` is a Note-4 unitary on `L\u00b2`.** This is Plancherel's theorem: Mathlib's `Lp.fourierTransform\u2097\u1d62` is a `\u2243\u2097\u1d62[\u2102]`, hence a Note-4 unitary",
      "nl": "**The Pauli\u2013Fourier transform `\ud835\udcd5_P` is a Note-4 unitary on `L\u00b2`.**  This is\nPlancherel's theorem: Mathlib's `Lp.fourierTransform\u2097\u1d62` is a `\u2243\u2097\u1d62[\u2102]`, hence a\nNote-4 unitary.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.fourierTransform_isNote4Unitary` (module `BookProof.MajoranaProp76`), line-linked source: `ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean` lines 133\u2013138.",
      "source": "https://github.com/leonardopedro/timepiece/blob/61595bc/BookProof/ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean#L133-L138",
      "tags": [
        "timepiece",
        "qym",
        "majorana",
        "particle-physics"
      ]
    },
    "BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_energyTransform_fourier_unitary": {
      "name": "BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.energyTransform_fourier_unitary",
      "chapter": "ChapterMajoranaProp76",
      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterMajoranaProp76_energyTransform_fourier_unitary.lean",
      "title": "The concrete energy transform on `L\u00b2` is a Note-4 unitary.** Conjugating the `L\u00b2`-Fourier transform by any linear isometry equivalence `\u0398` yields a Note-4 unitary \u2014 the honest realization",
      "nl": "**The concrete energy transform on `L\u00b2` is a Note-4 unitary.**  Conjugating\nthe `L\u00b2`-Fourier transform by any linear isometry equivalence `\u0398` yields a Note-4\nunitary \u2014 the honest realization of `\ud835\udcd4` in the Mathlib `L\u00b2` model.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterMajoranaProp76.energyTransform_fourier_unitary` (module `BookProof.MajoranaProp76`), line-linked source: `ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean` lines 140\u2013146.",
      "source": "https://github.com/leonardopedro/timepiece/blob/61595bc/BookProof/ChapterMajoranaProp76.lean#L140-L146",
      "tags": [
        "timepiece",
        "qym",
        "majorana",
        "particle-physics"
      ]
    },
    "BookProof_ChapterParityMajoranaQuant_iJ_herm": {
