      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterParityMajoranaQuant_iJ_herm.lean",
      "title": "`iJ` is Hermitian: `(iJ)\u1d34 = iJ`, using skew-adjointness `J\u1d34 = -J` and `conj i = -i`",
      "nl": "`iJ` is Hermitian: `(iJ)\u1d34 = iJ`, using skew-adjointness `J\u1d34 = -J` and `conj i = -i`.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterParityMajoranaQuant.iJ_herm` (module `BookProof.ParityMajoranaQuant`), line-linked source: `ChapterParityMajoranaQuant.lean` lines 75\u201378.",
