    "BookProof_ChapterParityMajoranaQuant_J_unitary": {
      "name": "BookProof.ChapterParityMajoranaQuant.J_unitary",
      "chapter": "ChapterParityMajoranaQuant",
      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterParityMajoranaQuant_J_unitary.lean",
      "title": "A compatible complex structure is **unitary**: `J\u1d34 \u00b7 J = 1`",
      "nl": "A compatible complex structure is **unitary**: `J\u1d34 \u00b7 J = 1`.  On a real inner-product\nspace, a skew-symmetric `J` with `J\u00b2 = -1` is orthogonal, so it preserves the metric \u2014 the\ncompatibility of the metric, the complex structure and the symplectic form `\u27e8v,Jw\u27e9`.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterParityMajoranaQuant.J_unitary` (module `BookProof.ParityMajoranaQuant`), line-linked source: `ChapterParityMajoranaQuant.lean` lines 144\u2013148.",
      "source": "https://github.com/leonardopedro/timepiece/blob/61595bc/BookProof/ChapterParityMajoranaQuant.lean#L144-L148",
      "tags": [
        "timepiece",
        "qym",
        "parity",
        "majorana",
        "quantization"
      ]
    },
