    "BookProof_ChapterSirkGroupTransfer_norm_groupFlow_sub_le": {
      "name": "BookProof.ChapterSirkGroupTransfer.norm_groupFlow_sub_le",
      "chapter": "ChapterSirkGroupTransfer",
      "file": "/home/leo/prove2me_workspace/Theorems/Thm_BookProof_ChapterSirkGroupTransfer_norm_groupFlow_sub_le.lean",
      "title": "The unitary-group transfer for bounded generators (\u00a712.2 Gap 3, the bounded half).** Two bounded generators of norm at most `M` produce propagators that differ by at most `|t| \u2016a \u2212 b\u2016 e^{|",
      "nl": "**The unitary-group transfer for bounded generators (\u00a712.2 Gap 3, the\nbounded half).**  Two bounded generators of norm at most `M` produce propagators\nthat differ by at most `|t| \u2016a \u2212 b\u2016 e^{|t| M}` at time `t`.\n\n\n\n**Formalization Note.** Lean 4 identifier: `BookProof.ChapterSirkGroupTransfer.norm_groupFlow_sub_le` (module `BookProof.SirkGroupTransfer`), line-linked source: `ChapterSirkGroupTransfer.lean` lines 157\u2013176.",
